ts models from gateway's /v1/models endpoint. Added claude project purge command, improved OAuth flow, and Windows PowerShell 7 detection. Fixed image handling and numerous security issues.\",\n    33→    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n    34→    \"url\": \"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog\",\n    35→    \"date\": \"2026-05-01\",\n    36→    \"community_feedback\": []\n    37→  },\n    38→  {\n    39→    \"productName\": \"Claude Code\",\n    40→    \"title\": \"Version 2.1.123 - OAuth Authentication Fix\",\n    41→    \"description\": \"Fixed OAuth authentication failing with 401 retry loop when CLAUDE_CODE_DISABLE_EXPERIMENTAL_BETAS=1 is set.\",\n    42→    \"updateType\": \"bugfix\",\n    43→    \"url\": \"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog\",\n    44→    \"date\": \"2026-04-29\",\n    45→    \"community_feedback\": []\n    46→  },\n    47→  {\n    48→    \"productName\": \"Claude Code\",\n    49→    \"title\": \"Version 2.1.122 - Bedrock Service Tier and PR URL Integration\",\n    50→    \"description\": \"Added ANTHROPIC_BEDROCK_SERVICE_TIER environment variable, PR URL paste support in /resume search box, and improved /mcp management. Enhanced OpenTelemetry logging and fixed numerous bugs.\",\n    51→    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n    52→    \"url\": \"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog\",\n    53→    \"date\": \"2026-04-28\",\n    54→    \"community_feedback\": []\n    55→  },\n    56→  {\n    57→    \"productName\": \"Claude Code\",\n    58→    \"title\": \"Version 2.1.121 - Performance Improvements and Plugin System\",\n    59→    \"description\": \"Added alwaysLoad option to MCP servers, claude plugin prune command, and type-to-filter search box for /skills. Fixed memory leaks (up to ~2GB), improved scrolling, and enhanced dialog handling.\",\n    60→    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n    61→    \"url\": \"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog\",\n    62→    \"date\": \"2026-04-28\",\n    63→    \"community_feedback\": []\n    64→  },\n    65→  {\n    66→    \"productName\": \"Claude Code\",\n    67→    \"title\": \"Version 2.1.120 - Windows PowerShell Integration\",\n    68→    \"description\": \"Git for Windows no longer required - Claude Code uses PowerShell when Git Bash is absent. Added claude ultrareview subcommand for CI/CD, improved /skills menu, and numerous bug fixes.\",\n    69→    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n    70→    \"url\": \"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog\",\n    71→    \"date\": \"2026-04-28\",\n    72→    \"community_feedback\": []\n    73→  }\n    74→]\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"
